{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"一种真切的期待已经成立，却还没有变成踏实的拥有；因此既有愿意靠近的欣喜，也有一点自然的克制和悬而未定。\",\"thread\":\"眼前已经有了足以让人觉得“这值得”的东西，所以期待不是空想；但人还没有真正从中得到什么，也没有经历可以证明它究竟能给到多少。于是此刻可以放心地期待，却还没有理由把自己完全交给这份期待。\",\"used\":\"无\",\"new\":[\"第一次有了一个可信的期待：这里似乎确实存在值得靠近、值得获得的东西。\",\"这份期待目前还只是可能得到的好，尚未经过实际满足来证明它能给到什么。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4b6039c3-0f51-482a-bacf-0cab16d69ccc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215651096025Z", "elapsed_seconds": 25.234, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T21:57:16.329111+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "66926aaa0575adf3b0f845e762cee27f7c7a2135f1851eeaa768cb47d9c87833", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "dir